    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a romantic visual novel with suspense + dark picture book + adult content </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Welcome to the Blue Forest, the nameless traveler.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Here, memory will be turned into pieces, played by the blind guide&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You, who lost your memory, woke up in a strange blue forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't know who you are, you don't know where you going</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the voice of &quot;You must protect this forest&quot; echoed in your mind, which seemed to be the only clue to solving your own mystery... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, to protect the forest, you were seriously injured and saved by the blind witch who lived alone in the depths of the forest\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The blind witch &quot;Evraco&quot;, this mysterious witch seems to be closely related to your past...? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Perfect for players who enjoy a deep plot atmosphere, light gameplay, pure love, and a unique worldview.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c7Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live with an elegant and beautiful witch and purify the forest together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the plot progresses, the mysteries of the world, Evraco, and even yourself will be brought to light</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic CGs: 20+<br> No difference</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18+ CGs: 40 <br> No difference</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(total:60+)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ OST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Endings</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>VA:\u88cf\u30ce\u88cf\u304a\u3082\u3066</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/75e054044b0b8b181f7feaf0d4d3e2d6.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/04a7a5cfa22effcacc39120ca0f25f3b.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/dc6e047facd9edf1a99778eaaa29a282.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/919f74efc8efaf557e13e815d086e0b4.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/0aee3fd5afbf9e4292e056a33922fcb9.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a romantic visual novel with suspense + dark picture book + adult content </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Welcome to the Blue Forest, the nameless traveler.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Here, memory will be turned into pieces, played by the blind guide&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You, who lost your memory, woke up in a strange blue forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't know who you are, you don't know where you going</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the voice of &quot;You must protect this forest&quot; echoed in your mind, which seemed to be the only clue to solving your own mystery... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, to protect the forest, you were seriously injured and saved by the blind witch who lived alone in the depths of the forest\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The blind witch &quot;Evraco&quot;, this mysterious witch seems to be closely related to your past...? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Perfect for players who enjoy a deep plot atmosphere, light gameplay, pure love, and a unique worldview.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c7Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live with an elegant and beautiful witch and purify the forest together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the plot progresses, the mysteries of the world, Evraco, and even yourself will be brought to light</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic CGs: 20+<br> No difference</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18+ CGs: 40 <br> No difference</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(total:60+)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ OST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Endings</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>VA:\u88cf\u30ce\u88cf\u304a\u3082\u3066</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/75e054044b0b8b181f7feaf0d4d3e2d6.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/04a7a5cfa22effcacc39120ca0f25f3b.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/dc6e047facd9edf1a99778eaaa29a282.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/919f74efc8efaf557e13e815d086e0b4.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894100/extras/0aee3fd5afbf9e4292e056a33922fcb9.avif?t=1737312360\" /></div></p>",
